{"2735580": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Netherworld Covenant", "steam_appid": 2735580, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Netherworld Covenant</strong> is a <i>dark fantasy 3D isometric action roguelike</i> centered on <i>precision combat</i> and <i>Soul Companion</i> powers to deliver a hardcore, strategically rich experience. Control the survivor of a catastrophic disaster, wielding the Nether Lantern—a forbidden artifact bridging the mortal realm and the netherworld—to forge pacts with the souls of deceased allies. Venture into procedurally generated labyrinths to challenge corrupted heroes and demonic lords.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/94ef9e81a1c87e8a00ddd0f859cb0fb0.poster.avif?t=1784568578\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/94ef9e81a1c87e8a00ddd0f859cb0fb0.webm?t=1784568578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/94ef9e81a1c87e8a00ddd0f859cb0fb0.mp4?t=1784568578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Complete Evolution! The Final Covenant Begins!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The highlights of <strong>Official 1.0 Version</strong> comparing to the <strong>Early Access</strong> include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expanded Class Depth:</strong> 5 new playable classes: Berserker, Mage, Hunter, Shield Guard, and Useless Person; 4 new weapons: Double-Bladed Axe, Staff, Bow, and Spear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Comprehensive Gameplay Upgrades:</strong> 2 new game modes: Boss Rush and Chaos Mode; 2 new difficulty modes: Iron Crown Frenzy and Corruption Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete Story Progression:</strong> Addition of Chapters 5 and 6, completing the ending animation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>System Overhaul &amp; Massive Content Additions:</strong> Significant additions and restructuring of the Aura and Relic systems; Expanded variety of random events, accessories, and secondary weapons; Over 50 optimizations covering character mobility, resource allocation, and balance adjustments; 4 new character skins</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/e6ae61ea6430e670f95c79252240eda0.poster.avif?t=1784568578\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/e6ae61ea6430e670f95c79252240eda0.webm?t=1784568578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/e6ae61ea6430e670f95c79252240eda0.mp4?t=1784568578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Beauty of Precision</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat prioritizes tactical mastery over frenetic combos. Parry, dodge, and execute Ethereal Dash to evade attacks, then counter with lethal strikes. Every decision—timing, resource allocation, and positioning—deepens the strategic depth of encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/5ff5cc170f207ee17e4c060ad1516581.poster.avif?t=1784568578\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/5ff5cc170f207ee17e4c060ad1516581.webm?t=1784568578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/5ff5cc170f207ee17e4c060ad1516581.mp4?t=1784568578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bound by Souls, Empowered by the Dead</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Soul Companion system offers diverse combat strategies, featuring four distinct spectral allies: Swordsman, Ranger, Guardian, and Rogue. Harness their abilities to phase through obstacles, ambush foes from the netherworld, or evade fatal blows by shifting dimensions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/30984b69f11545c04e85ff14dba7f8e5.poster.avif?t=1784568578\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/30984b69f11545c04e85ff14dba7f8e5.webm?t=1784568578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/30984b69f11545c04e85ff14dba7f8e5.mp4?t=1784568578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Corrupted Legends Await</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face bosses twisted by malevolent soul energy—fallen lords, once-noble knights, primordial demons, and entities lurking in the dimensional void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/12414ff3ee17ae0bce708eafbe65d77e.poster.avif?t=1784568578\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/12414ff3ee17ae0bce708eafbe65d77e.webm?t=1784568578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/12414ff3ee17ae0bce708eafbe65d77e.mp4?t=1784568578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sanctuary at the Edge of Realms</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the borderland camp between worlds, gather spectral allies, forge weapons tainted with demonic blood, stockpile resources, and piece together the truth behind calamity through fragmented dialogues. Will you redeem your comrades’ souls or remain stuck between life and death?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/81dc4d49bc24d8eae0dc68f91edaef0c.poster.avif?t=1784568578\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/81dc4d49bc24d8eae0dc68f91edaef0c.webm?t=1784568578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/81dc4d49bc24d8eae0dc68f91edaef0c.mp4?t=1784568578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>“The Torch’s light reveals no path to salvation, only the shadow of a gamble: as spectral forces tear through demonic throats, the wielder’s name may yet become another epitaph on the Covenant Stone.”</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Netherworld Covenant</strong> is a <i>dark fantasy 3D isometric action roguelike</i> centered on <i>precision combat</i> and <i>Soul Companion</i> powers to deliver a hardcore, strategically rich experience. Control the survivor of a catastrophic disaster, wielding the Nether Lantern—a forbidden artifact bridging the mortal realm and the netherworld—to forge pacts with the souls of deceased allies. Venture into procedurally generated labyrinths to challenge corrupted heroes and demonic lords.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/94ef9e81a1c87e8a00ddd0f859cb0fb0.poster.avif?t=1784568578\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/94ef9e81a1c87e8a00ddd0f859cb0fb0.webm?t=1784568578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/94ef9e81a1c87e8a00ddd0f859cb0fb0.mp4?t=1784568578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Complete Evolution! The Final Covenant Begins!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The highlights of <strong>Official 1.0 Version</strong> comparing to the <strong>Early Access</strong> include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expanded Class Depth:</strong> 5 new playable classes: Berserker, Mage, Hunter, Shield Guard, and Useless Person; 4 new weapons: Double-Bladed Axe, Staff, Bow, and Spear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Comprehensive Gameplay Upgrades:</strong> 2 new game modes: Boss Rush and Chaos Mode; 2 new difficulty modes: Iron Crown Frenzy and Corruption Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete Story Progression:</strong> Addition of Chapters 5 and 6, completing the ending animation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>System Overhaul &amp; Massive Content Additions:</strong> Significant additions and restructuring of the Aura and Relic systems; Expanded variety of random events, accessories, and secondary weapons; Over 50 optimizations covering character mobility, resource allocation, and balance adjustments; 4 new character skins</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/e6ae61ea6430e670f95c79252240eda0.poster.avif?t=1784568578\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/e6ae61ea6430e670f95c79252240eda0.webm?t=1784568578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/e6ae61ea6430e670f95c79252240eda0.mp4?t=1784568578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Beauty of Precision</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat prioritizes tactical mastery over frenetic combos. Parry, dodge, and execute Ethereal Dash to evade attacks, then counter with lethal strikes. Every decision—timing, resource allocation, and positioning—deepens the strategic depth of encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/5ff5cc170f207ee17e4c060ad1516581.poster.avif?t=1784568578\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/5ff5cc170f207ee17e4c060ad1516581.webm?t=1784568578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/5ff5cc170f207ee17e4c060ad1516581.mp4?t=1784568578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bound by Souls, Empowered by the Dead</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Soul Companion system offers diverse combat strategies, featuring four distinct spectral allies: Swordsman, Ranger, Guardian, and Rogue. Harness their abilities to phase through obstacles, ambush foes from the netherworld, or evade fatal blows by shifting dimensions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/30984b69f11545c04e85ff14dba7f8e5.poster.avif?t=1784568578\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/30984b69f11545c04e85ff14dba7f8e5.webm?t=1784568578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/30984b69f11545c04e85ff14dba7f8e5.mp4?t=1784568578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Corrupted Legends Await</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face bosses twisted by malevolent soul energy—fallen lords, once-noble knights, primordial demons, and entities lurking in the dimensional void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/12414ff3ee17ae0bce708eafbe65d77e.poster.avif?t=1784568578\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/12414ff3ee17ae0bce708eafbe65d77e.webm?t=1784568578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/12414ff3ee17ae0bce708eafbe65d77e.mp4?t=1784568578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sanctuary at the Edge of Realms</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the borderland camp between worlds, gather spectral allies, forge weapons tainted with demonic blood, stockpile resources, and piece together the truth behind calamity through fragmented dialogues. Will you redeem your comrades’ souls or remain stuck between life and death?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/81dc4d49bc24d8eae0dc68f91edaef0c.poster.avif?t=1784568578\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/81dc4d49bc24d8eae0dc68f91edaef0c.webm?t=1784568578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/81dc4d49bc24d8eae0dc68f91edaef0c.mp4?t=1784568578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>“The Torch’s light reveals no path to salvation, only the shadow of a gamble: as spectral forces tear through demonic throats, the wielder’s name may yet become another epitaph on the Covenant Stone.”</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "In the abyss where the mortal realm and netherworld intertwine, become a warrior wielding the power of the Nether Lantern to fight along with the fallen souls. With hardcore, soulslike action and intriguing roguelike builds, shatter the cursed barriers and unveil the truth woven from blood and soul.", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Japanese, Korean, Turkish, Portuguese - Brazil, Spanish - Latin America", "reviews": "“Transforming the core action RPG experience from games like Diablo or Path of Exile into a roguelike might sound very difficult. Yet Netherworld Covenant is a game that manages to successfully do that and even better”<br>Softpedia<br><br>“Netherworld Covenant captures the feeling of a Dark Souls game in both its grim worldbuilding and presentation, as well as its fast-paced, reflex-demanding combat mechanics. The game can easily make you feel punished or supremely powerful based on your build, playstyle, and mastery of its mechanics.”<br>Try Hard Guides<br><br>“Netherworld Covenant est clairement le type d’accès anticipé que j’apprécie : une vraie proposition, un contenu day one conséquent, une production optimisée et un un plan de vol déjà en partie annoncé.”<br>IGN France<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/0799cb20b36dd4f656ff12e51ff034ac8040b833/header.jpg?t=1784568578", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/aca93271cd104ff4bec744e9344f2aa01a6ba568/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784568578", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/aca93271cd104ff4bec744e9344f2aa01a6ba568/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784568578", "website": "https://www.infinifunstudios.com/gameDetail?id=3", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1050 Ti<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS X 10.12+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual core from Intel or Apple silicon<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia 450 GTS / Radeon HD 5750 or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<st